  "notes": "Boot a Creature from the Black Lagoon ROM from an empty NVRAM with the coin door open and PinMAME's built-in mechanisms disabled. Start T.1 SWITCH EDGES and drive, one at a time, an ordinary rollover (25, P of P-A-I-D), a masked opto (34, Right Popper) and the four upper Fliptronic positions 115-118 to public 1 and back to 0, two frames 0.4 s apart at each level. cftblGameData declares FLIP_SW(FLIP_L | FLIP_U) but FLIP_SOL(FLIP_L), so PinMAME synthesizes none of 115-118; the frames show whether the ROM reads and names each position.",
